{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205360","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205360","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1520536001:0":{"text":"Morgan, how are you feeling now?","source_cn":"摩根，现在感觉怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528FE4E80BF9E637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520536002:0":{"text":"...I'm alright. Thank you.","source_cn":"……还不错，谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE63BF7AFB30AFA38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1520536002":{"text":"...I'm alright. Thank you.","source_cn":"……还不错，谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE63BF7AFB30AFA38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520536003:0":{"text":"I'm just thanking Merlin. You two are just lucky to be included.","source_cn":"我在谢梅林，你和那个小家伙是顺带的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x142BF216835D8E3D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm just thanking Merlin. You two are just lucky to be included.","female":"I'm just thanking Merlin. You two are just lucky to be included.","variant_male_record_index":"185231","variant_female_record_index":"185232","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520536006:0":{"text":"Welcome... Are you guys here to help with the ritual?","source_cn":"噢噢……你们也来协助主持祭祀仪式？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F8F58195281DB56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520536007:0":{"text":"That's right. When does the ritual start? The Arcane Council's good to go.","source_cn":"是的，请问祭祀什么时候开始？魔法师协会已经准备万全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FAB20397924D4BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520536008:0":{"text":"The families of the fallen warriors are eager to be here. Once the signal horn sounds, it'll take them some time to get here from Wrathwood Grove...","source_cn":"关于这点，死去战士们的亲人都希望能过来观礼。等吹响传讯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28A9EF9D067DA345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520536009:0":{"text":"I'd say we can start around <style=\"highlight\">sunset</style>.","source_cn":"老朽估算，大概<style=highlight>太阳下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA2A86B5F63E333A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520536010:0":{"text":"Good, let's take a breather.","source_cn":"太好了，休息时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E4A6A585A66975F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520536011:0":{"text":"By the way, this ritual will be slightly different from how you usually do it.","source_cn":"对了，这次祭祀仪式会和你们以往经历的形式有些许不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D93FC8E708853AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1520536012:0":{"text":"When everyone's here, be sure to give them a heads-up.","source_cn":"等其他人到之后，让他们做好心理准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC6FE62A6C3FAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520536013:0":{"text":"... Maybe I'm too old to grasp what you mean.","source_cn":"……老朽，不明白？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8357C0EDEB2ABBA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1520536013":{"text":"... Maybe I'm too old to grasp what you mean.","source_cn":"……老朽，不明白？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8357C0EDEB2ABBA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520536014:0":{"text":"Just do as I say.","source_cn":"照做就是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE237A9C6249BDF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1520536015:0":{"text":"Modra, Morgan's helping us.","source_cn":"蒙多，摩根是在帮我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43211C2ABA48E6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520536016:0":{"text":"Alright, I'll talk to the families when they arrive.","source_cn":"好吧……等逝去之人的亲属到齐，老朽会事先言明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DBE85F542122343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520536017:0":{"text":"Good. I'm going to get some rest now.","source_cn":"很好，我也要休息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6A00D65B27CBB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520536018:0":{"text":"No one is to disturb me before sunset.","source_cn":"黄昏之前，谁都别来叫我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEF86EEFCC436C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"I have a bad feeling...","source_cn":"哎呀，不好的预感……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB87E224C0ACA61B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I have a bad feeling...","female":"I have a bad feeling...","variant_male_record_index":"78603","variant_female_record_index":"78604","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"How different can it be?","source_cn":"能玩出什么花样？